  "description": "【Unstoppable Power for Smooth Rides】Designed for trail riding and commuting, Happyrun Tank electric bike is equipped with a high-performance 1500W (rated power: 750W) brushless motor that can boost a top speed of 30 MPH. Packing enough juice to conquer various road conditions and hills, it rides like a champ\n【Take You Further】Tank ebike features a removable 48V 18AH battery that can cover a range of 68 miles (with pedal assistance) on a single 5-6 hour charge. The removable design allows you to conveniently charge the battery at home or in the office\n【Classic Design】With an impressive retro motorcycle frame design, combined with a modern electrical system, this adult dirt bike is a true example of a tribute to the classics, both stylish and retro. riding it is like stepping back in time to that exciting era.\n【Explore New Paths】The 20\" × 4\" fat tires provide extra protection against punctures from thorns, glass, and other small materials, making it possible to ride on sandy, snowy, and other complex terrains, turning adventures into worry-free experiences\n【Long-Distance Comfort】The high-performance front fork suspension and seat suspension absorb most of the bumps on the road, providing a smoother and more comfortable riding experience. The dual mechanical disc brakes provide excellent stopping power, gradually, under various road conditions\n【Ready to Roll】The electric bike comes pre-assembled by 90%, so you don't have to waste time on complicated assembly. Please keep the original packaging of the electric bike temporarily in case return it\n【Available Services】A two-year warranty is provided for the electric motor, battery, and charger. If you have any questions, please feel free to let us know and we will respond within 24 hours.",
